{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_10_beg",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_10",
  "title": "再見，再見",
  "storyCode": "BB-10",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4db216ee7ec3667e1b9c9cae7f8b138dc1b9eb3957ec3144e67a5132e9ec1f6c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭很慶倖阿米婭睡著了。\n阿米婭沒有看見博士的背叛，也沒有看見特蕾西婭最後的悲傷。\n在特蕾西婭將議長室中的最後一名刺客抹除的同時，那頂黑色的王冠終於安穩地傳遞到了阿米婭的手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事了，阿米婭，沒事了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她沒有看向那個已經僵直在原地的人，只是輕輕拍了拍懷中孩子的後背，在那張稚嫩的小臉上，落下一吻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特蕾西婭。我沒辦法放棄億萬生命和萬年時間才換來的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒辦法允許你們突破源石的規劃。沒辦法允許你……將這片大地變成一個美好但短暫的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，你傷害了阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……既然魔王已看過了我的記憶，那我們多說無益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你恨我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你傷害了阿米婭，你也即將傷害凱爾希，和那些信任你的將士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是你對待如今這些生命的方式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會盡全力保證他們不在接下來的衝突中喪命。這也是特雷西斯給我的承諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要……你的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……博士，你是出於此刻的愧疚而來到我面前的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起我所做的事情，愧疚的份量……太輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在凱爾希都不熟知的年代裡，我們做出了太多選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等阿米婭長大後，若她還記得我，若她問起我，你是否會如實告知她……我是怎樣離去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會幫助他們尋找另一種生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尋找在源石毀滅泰拉之前最後的安穩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……抱歉。這無法改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你明知道這無法改變……你卻仍舊，想治好阿米婭的病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕在不遠的未來，阿米婭的家人、家鄉，和你們未來可能建立起聯繫的那些人和事，都將成為不變的源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也不忍看著眼前的孩子受苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是你的真心。是你的純潔。是你的本性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我其實……很欣慰，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很高興，凱爾希願意相信的那個你，願意相信我們的那個你，是真實存在的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你……源石的締造者……{@nickname}。你是毀去一切的毒，也可以是一切的解藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看見特蕾西婭強撐著站起，將雙手伸向自己，博士本能地想要後退。\n博士卻發現自己的身體無法移動分毫，博士發現自己的悲傷遠勝自己強撐的理性。\n只好任由特蕾西婭觸碰面罩之下的面龐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在落淚，博士……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，你就是這樣的人。你明知道自身的脆弱，明知道哪怕是此時的我，也對你有致命的威脅……你還是來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，我還是……願意相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相信原本的你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相信那個，將雨露和豔陽帶給我們的{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這一張臉，既熟悉又陌生。特蕾西婭清楚它的樣子。\n她從未有機會如此直觀地從上面捕捉到情緒。\n她微笑著伸出手指，眼前的景象猶如布匹一般被撕裂開。\n隨後，她緩緩抽出自裂口處鬆脫的絲線，殘餘的畫面也散解開來，博士的記憶不斷消散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭頭也不回地繼續深入，繼續將每一寸組成博士靈魂的記憶都拆解為一團團蒼白混亂的斷線。\n像是很久很久之前的夜晚，幼小的她在特雷西斯身旁自學縫紉那般。\n記憶消散殆盡，靈魂只剩下了最後一枚碎片。\n而記憶的盡頭處有一個背影。特蕾西婭對那個背影熟悉而又陌生。\n那是博士，也不是博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然已經是最後了，但我突然想賣個關子，你可不要怪我啊，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會對你說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“去找到你自己吧。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
